[{"name":"Items","children":[{"name":"Record","foreach":"/Items/Record","children":[{"name":"Products","foreach":"Products","children":[{"name":"Product","foreach":"Product","children":[{"name":"ProductCode","value":{"xpath":"ProductCode"}},{"name":"","type":3,"value":{"custom":"<arc:set attr=\"data.WorkspaceId\" value=\"ExcelToStateTable\" />\n<arc:set attr=\"data.ConnectorId\" value=\"OutOfStockStorage\" />\n<arc:set attr=\"data.key\" value=\"[xpath(ProductCode)]_ScheduleAfter\" />\n<arc:set attr=\"_map.LeadTimeDays\" value=\"\" />\n<arc:call op=\"connectordataGet\" item=\"data\">\n  <arc:check attr=\"data.value\">\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.Status\" value=\"OutOfStock\" />\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.ShipAfter\" value=\"[data.value]\" /> \n    <arc:else>\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.Status\" value=\"InStock\" />\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.ShipAfter\" value=\"\" /> \n    </arc:else>\n    </arc:check>\n</arc:call>\n\n<arc:set attr=\"data.ConnectorId\" value=\"LeadTimesStorage\" />\n<arc:set attr=\"data.key\" value=\"[xpath(ProductCode)]_LeadTimeDays\" />\n<arc:call op=\"connectordataGet\" item=\"data\">\n  <arc:check attr=\"data.value\">\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.LeadTimeDays\" value=\"[data.value]\" />\n    <arc:else>\n  <arc:set attr=\"_map.LeadTimeDays\" value=\"Lead Times not found\" />\n    </arc:else>\n    </arc:check>\n</arc:call>\n"},"scriptName":"LookupProductCode"},{"name":"Status","value":{"custom":"[_map.Status | def]"}},{"name":"LeadTime","value":{"custom":"[_map.LeadTimeDays | def]"}},{"name":"ShipAfter","value":{"custom":"[_map.ShipAfter | def]"}}]}]}]}]}]